window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Unravel the mystery. Expose the truth. Survive the web.</b></p> <p><i>In the sun-drenched hills of Tuscany, a sinister secret lurks beneath the cobblestones...</i></p> <p>Mandy Logan and her father Bear were hoping for a peaceful Italian getaway. Instead, they've stumbled into a web of conspiracy that stretches from the winding streets of San Gimignano to the hallowed halls of the Vatican.</p> <p>When Mandy befriends local twins Sofia and Lorenzo, she's drawn into the decade-old mystery of Lucia Moretti, a young girl who vanished without a trace. But as Mandy digs deeper, she uncovers an underground network of smugglers, spies, and sanctuary seekers that will challenge everything she thought she knew about right and wrong.</p> <p>With Sofia suddenly kidnapped and a rival faction threatening to destroy the entire operation, Mandy and Bear must race against time to save not only their new friends but also hundreds of innocent lives. Navigating ancient tunnels and dodging ruthless enemies, they're forced to confront impossible choices and uncomfortable truths.</p> <p>In a world where nothing is as it seems, can Mandy learn to balance her insatiable curiosity with the weight of dangerous knowledge? And will Bear's hard-earned wisdom be enough to guide them through this labyrinth of deceit?</p> <p>Caught in the Web is a heart-pounding thriller that will keep you guessing until the very last word. Wall Street Journal bestselling author L.T. Ryan and K.M. Rought deliver a masterful blend of action, intrigue, and coming-of-age drama that proves family bonds are tested hardest when the stakes are highest.</p>"; 
